  "method": "Actual webapp handler and TensorUploads, ephemeral disk files. base64 and raw: 256 KiB chunks, a fresh TCP connection per request; raw-reuse: the production HTTPTransport on one kept-alive connection; raw-reuse-4m: the same with negotiated 4 MiB chunks. No TLS/compression. Includes create, encode, HTTP, hashes, finite checks, file writes and finalize. Excludes input generation and read-back verification. Alternating order after warmups. Memory is a separate tracemalloc pass across client and server, including read-back, not total RSS. Request body bytes exclude HTTP headers, responses and TCP overhead.",
